ImageViewer patch (docs/PLAN.md section 15, D-57): FITS rows are stored bottom first: row y is height - 1 - y
Library: openimageio 3.2.1.1
Fixes: none (a wrong image, not a vulnerability)
Upstream: AcademySoftwareFoundation/OpenImageIO #5555, on main after 3.2.1.3 (ours, upstreamed)
Remove when: a release contains #5555 (the update script removes a patch the release already contains)

OpenImageIO 3.2.1.1 read every FITS row one off (0.4 review). Test: tests/smoke.sh, rows.fits.

